        <mxCell id="pvBFkPtZa2JNvjyv9aTQ-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=25;" value="You aren&#39;t just saying &quot;I think it&#39;s bad.&quot; You are saying &quot;I know it&#39;s True Positive or Fales positive&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;98&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;because&lt;/b&gt; I saw &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;X&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;112&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;X&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and verified it with &lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;Y&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;135&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;.&quot;" vertex="1">
